Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w5"}

Thought: The ranking is unstable and several models are correlated; a smaller, more stable subset may improve performance. I will test a weighted combination on the top‑7 models by smape to see if focusing on the best performers helps.  
Action: select_top_k  
