Thought: test a robust dba combination on the full pool to see if iterative reweighting improves over weighted forward.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: The series has unstable ranking and strong seasonality, so a per‑horizon “best‑per‑horizon” weighting on a smaller, diverse pool may capture horizon‑specific strengths.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"best_per_horizon"}

Thought: test a per‑model softmax‑negative‑error weighting on the full pool to see if a more aggressive softmax improves over the forward‑selection winner.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

