Thought: test a simple mean on the reduced pool4 to see if a robust central tendency on a smaller, more correlated subset improves over weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4","rationale":"mean on correlated subset"}

